# Arm B is mined from the user's own local Claude Code transcripts. It never leaves the
# machine and is never committed — regenerate it with `bun mine-transcripts.ts --redact`.
corpus-b.json

# Run output. Holds arm-B chunks inline, so it carries the same privacy constraint as the
# corpus itself — findings go in the ticket resolution, never the raw rows.
*.jsonl
*.log

# OPENAI_API_KEY for the stage-3 speaker. Bun auto-loads this from the run directory.
.env
